---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../data/site';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | Faber Concrete"
  description="How Faber Concrete collects, uses, and protects your information when you request an estimate in Metro Detroit."
>
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-14 space-y-6 text-sm leading-relaxed">
    <h1 class="font-display font-bold text-4xl uppercase">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-muted">Last updated: July 22, 2026</p>
    <p>
      This Privacy Policy explains how Faber Concrete (“we,” “us,” or “our”) collects, uses, and shares information when you visit our website or request an estimate in Farmington Hills and Wayne, Oakland, Macomb, Washtenaw, and Livingston counties.
    </p>
    <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-xl uppercase">1. Information We Collect</h2>
    <p>
      We collect information you provide directly, including your name, phone number, email address, property street address, and project notes, as well as basic technical analytics data.
    </p>
    <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-xl uppercase">2. How We Use Information</h2>
    <p>
      We use your information to verify ZIP code coverage, schedule on-site inspections, prepare written estimates and contracts, and communicate project updates. We do not sell your personal information.
    </p>
    <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-xl uppercase">3. SMS &amp; Phone Communications</h2>
    <p>
      If you provide a phone number and consent to be contacted, we may call or text you about your estimate or project status. Reply STOP to opt out of SMS at any time.
    </p>
    <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-xl uppercase">4. Contact Us</h2>
    <p>
      {SITE.name} · {SITE.address.formatted} · {SITE.phone}
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
